# Advanced Numerical Simulations in Mechanical Engineering

**Authors:** Ashwani Kumar, P. Patil, Yogesh K. Prajapati

## Abstract
Advanced Numerical Simulations in Mechanical Engineering is a pivotal reference source for the latest research ndings on advanced modelling and simulation method adopted in mechanical and mechatronics engineering. Featuring extensive coverage on relevant areas such as fuzzy logic controllers, nite element analysis, and analytical models, this publication is an ideal resource for students, professional engineers, and researchers interested in the application of numerical simulations in mechanical engineering.

